# state (the backend root keeps local state; env/platform state lives in S3), providers, plans
**/.terraform/
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.*
**/.terraform.tfstate.lock.info
**/plan.txt
**/apply.txt
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfplan

# Day 16: the platform root reads chart versions from a copy of infra/local's file; the
# chart cache is derived (helm pull) and never committed
!platform/chart-versions.auto.tfvars
platform/charts/
